                    briefing_text_r2:       `Rebuild the portfolio <strong>inside the frozen EUR 14.6M</strong> — every euro you build for the ~2.800-learner gap must come from something you retire or digitize. Then set the delivery mix per priority: digital/blended at <strong>€190/learner</strong> scales reach; classroom at <strong>€1.180/learner</strong> builds depth. Consultative selling and leadership are relational, judgment-heavy skills — <em>push them to a cheap self-paced video and you reach everyone and change nothing</em>. Lift priority-capability reach toward the target without breaching the budget and without gutting the relational objective.`,
