                    r3_invest_hint:         `Measurement isn’t free — but with zero of 312 courses carrying a business-impact measure, too little here leaves you defending the redesign with the same smile sheets the CEO already rejected. Decide where measurement is worth its cost.`,
                    metric_business:        `Business outcomes — behavior change plus leading operational indicators (service-contract attach rate, mean-time-to-resolution) feeding a business-impact index`,
